    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mannequin House is a horror game where you collect paintings while running away from the Mannequins that come your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >people who want to be scared</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who want to be surprised</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who are tired of playing errand games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A broadcaster with a reputation for good reactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >story: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragments of a story unite in the &quot;SukuuMono&quot; series </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is the house of a wealthy mannequin designer on an island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to rumors, the owner of the house has a hobby of collecting high-quality paintings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The owner is not home today. This is your chance to steal the painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains many scary scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect paintings while running away from the Mannequins that attacks you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis game has a single ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Actor games can be distributed without permission,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want as many people as possible to know about it and as many people as possible to enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would appreciate it if you could mention my store page when you post videos, distribute, etc! (Of course, it's not mandatory!)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mannequin House is a horror game where you collect paintings while running away from the Mannequins that come your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >people who want to be scared</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who want to be surprised</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who are tired of playing errand games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A broadcaster with a reputation for good reactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >story: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragments of a story unite in the &quot;SukuuMono&quot; series </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is the house of a wealthy mannequin designer on an island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to rumors, the owner of the house has a hobby of collecting high-quality paintings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The owner is not home today. This is your chance to steal the painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains many scary scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect paintings while running away from the Mannequins that attacks you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis game has a single ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Actor games can be distributed without permission,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want as many people as possible to know about it and as many people as possible to enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would appreciate it if you could mention my store page when you post videos, distribute, etc! (Of course, it's not mandatory!)</p>",
